<title>USA: New York physical copper market.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for February shipment were quoted at a nominal 115.00 to 115.25 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 90.00 cents, up three cents from February 18th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
